| Pilot city | Clichy, France (92110) |

Platform checklists: [docs/platforms.md](../../docs/platforms.md). Do not document São Paulo as the default pilot city or Supabase as the auth choice unless comparing alternatives.

## PR checklist (short)

- [ ] Tests cover new/changed behavior
- [ ] Docs updated when workflow or architecture changes
- [ ] No em dashes in new titles or README edits
- [ ] `validation.sh` passes locally
- [ ] PR rebases cleanly on `main`
